# Festag — dashboard theme parity

Dashboard and Festag OS shell design changes apply to **all** themes the same way:

- Light
- Read
- Dark (and classic-dark)

## Do

- Change structure, spacing, hierarchy, and chrome once — tokens adapt color only
- Keep the same sidebar header (Workspace label + name + utilities), nav, and footer in every theme
- Prefer shared CSS variables (`--fas-*`, `--portal-*`) over theme-forked layouts

## Do not

- Ship a light-only or dark-only sidebar layout
- Hide collapse / workspace switcher / Einstellungen in one theme
- Invent a second chrome for dark that does not exist in light/read
